#: ../../doc/old/old/read/expr/relay-add-op.ipynb:10002
msgid "添加 relay 算子"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/expr/relay-add-op.ipynb:10004
msgid "参考：[relay_add_op](https://xinetzone.github.io/tvm/docs/dev/how_to/relay_add_op.html)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/expr/relay-add-op.ipynb:20002
msgid ""
"属性是固定的参数，应该在编译时就知道。比如卷积算子的 `stride` 和 `expand` "
"是属于卷积算子属性节点的字段的适当的例子。属性一般定义在 `include/tvm/relay/attrs/` 文件夹中，也可以直接通过 "
"Python 接口定义："
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/expr/relay-add-op.ipynb:30002
msgid "`register_op_attr` 函数用于注册算子的属性。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/expr/relay-add-op.ipynb:30004
msgid "参数："
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/expr/relay-add-op.ipynb:30005
msgid "`op_name`（str 类型）：算子的名称。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/expr/relay-add-op.ipynb:30006
msgid "`attr_key`（str 类型）：属性的名称。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/expr/relay-add-op.ipynb:30007
msgid "`value`（object 类型，可选）：要设置的值。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/expr/relay-add-op.ipynb:30008
msgid "`level`（int 类型，可选）：优先级级别，默认为 `10`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/expr/relay-add-op.ipynb:30010
msgid "返回值："
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/expr/relay-add-op.ipynb:30011
msgid "如果 `value` 没有指定，则返回注册函数 `fregister`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/expr/relay-add-op.ipynb:30012
msgid "如果 `value` 指定了，则直接返回注册函数 `_register(value)`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/read/expr/relay-add-op.ipynb:30014
msgid "内部函数 `_register` 用于实际执行算子注册，它调用了 `_ffi_api.RegisterOpAttr` 函数来注册算子的属性。"
msgstr ""

